    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "了解營銷概念及其隱秘的哲學，以及如何將這些概念應用於實際工作場所。\r\n將合理的解決方案應用於分析證據支持的實際營銷問題。\r\n系統地分析營銷過程並整合營銷組合、工具和理論。",
      "describe_en": "Understand concepts of marketing and its veiled philosophy and how these can be applied to the actual work place.\r\nApply plausible solutions to practical marketing issues supported by evidence from analysis.\r\nAnalyze the marketing process and integrating marketing mix, tools and theory in a systematic way."
    }
  ],
