    "tpa_score_new": null,
    "tpa_score_new_en": "<div>Assessment&nbsp;Grade</div>\n\n<div>In session Assessment</div>\n\n<div>30% -&nbsp;Mid-term presentation and group paper (15% + 15% = 30% total)</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>Attendance&nbsp;and Contribution to Discussion in Cases/Presentations=&nbsp;30%</div>\n\n<div>Attendance &ndash; you must arrive no later than 10 minutes after the bell when class begins.</div>\n\n<div>Discussion &ndash; Comments, feedback and discussion during case studies and group presentations.&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>In-class quizzes (10%) &ndash; 5 quizzes.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>Post&nbsp;session assessment</div>\n\n<div>Final&nbsp;presentation and individual paper (15% + 15% = 30% total)</div>\n",
    "course_pol": null,
    "course_pol_en": "1. Your group will conduct a marketing environment analysis (internal and external) of a business of your choice. As part of your presentation, you must state and justify why the marketing decisions taken were good or bad.\n2. All team members must speak, all must contribute.\n3. Group written paper – no more than 10 pages, excluding table of contents, references and appendices.\nSubmission Deadline: Group written paper is due 24 hours prior to the presentation.\n \n\nAttendance – you must arrive no later than 10 minutes after the bell when class begins.\nDiscussion – Comments, feedback and discussion during case studies and group presentations.\n \nQuizzes - 5 in class quizzes, evenly weighted.\n \nPost session assessment\n1. You will plan and execute a new marketing strategy for the business you described in your midterm presentation. Include segmentation, targeting, positioning and a marketing mix. This should extend your earlier work. Describe how, and why it is suitable for that specific business and estimate the cost of completing the project.\n2. Individual written paper – no more than 5 pages, excluding table of contents, references and appendices",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": null,
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>Intellectual property is the basic&nbsp;unit for economic growth so any opportunist behavior against this is not allowed. &nbsp;Promoting the quality of&nbsp;future trustworthy business contact, I will add bonus score&nbsp;on participation. open. AI is encouraged to use, but you have to have your statement&nbsp;belonging to yourself.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>homework writing should be in your voice not either coped&nbsp;sentence.</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
